  "display_name": "Monkeywrench",
  "display_fullname": "Mastermind Summon Robotics Monkeywrench",
  "display_help": "Your genius culminates in a moment of glory as you deploy an overclocked, extremely dangerous robot who strides into battle beneath a patch of viscious grease. The leftover grease compounds into a living entity that sets fire to your enemies. With a bit of luck, using this power will grant you a short-lived opportunity to imitate the creations of defeated opponents with the spare parts you have available. Your odds of accessing one of these additional creations improve with each Master of badge you have earned.",
